Add a mobile keyboard toolbar (Esc/Tab/Ctrl/Alt/Shift/arrows/Enter/...) and a
virtual-keyboard-aware layout for touch devices.

The toolbar provides keys soft keyboards do not expose, remixes sticky
modifiers into soft-keyboard keydowns (Ctrl+C and friends) and re-anchors the
workbench to the visual viewport so the soft keyboard does not cover the
editor. Controlled by the mobileKeyboard.enabled setting (auto/on/off).

